    "note": "Nothing is planned. Build obligation B-graph-recurrent is built (WP B03, closed at gate A by WP B14): the eight blocks rnn, attention_pool, gcn_conv, sage_conv, gat_conv, gin_conv, graph_pool, edge_dropout are in `blocks`, in pure PyTorch (torch.nn.RNN; message passing over index_add_ / scatter_reduce), and the nine families that needed them compile. torch_geometric stays declared below as an optional accelerated path the backend does not use. The collapsed-binary metrics (mcc_binary, roc_auc_binary, pr_auc_binary; build obligation C9) are neither built nor planned here: a spec that names one is refused by B2 as not implemented by this backend's metrics.py.",
